7T15:44:39.135049+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-d3.1","local_name":"bob-cli-d3.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-d3","agent_clan_generation":"20261027112205","bead_id":"bob-cli-d3.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-d3[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Saved Markdown, code, and link catalogs for web-article references[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]References that bob ref create captures from web-article URLs [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim](single URL, -H saved HTML, rereads, multi-URL collections, and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]their -f overwrite replacements) get a saved source.md and a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]code/link catalog, so the Bob Mac Capture Refs Copy card's M, C, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and L modes work for them exactly as for Markdown-born references.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]web_ref_saved_sources.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/web_ref_saved_sources.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-d3[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-d3/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Renderer emits the source view and code anchors[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]adapter-source-view[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]adapter-source-view: web-clip adapter keeps image origins, writes [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]render/source.html and render/code-anchors.json, injects [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Chrome-destination anchors for every printed pre, and reports both [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]paths; the Rust client decodes them.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Single web articles save source.md and a catalog[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]web-article-store[dim] · [dim][/dim]after adapter-source-view[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]web-article-store: read Chrome catalog /Dests, convert the source view [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to GFM, catalog it with the existing filters, map anchor and annotation [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pages, and write the web_article store and pointer on every [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]single-article create path, with tests and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Multi-URL collections save one source and catalog[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]web-collection-store[dim] · [dim][/dim]after web-article-store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]web-collection-store: persist a web_collection store from the compose [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]response before collection intake, numbering anchors across parts.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Web overwrites repoint instead of clearing[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]web-overwrite-store[dim] · [dim][/dim]after web-collection-store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]web-overwrite-store: stage the new web store inside the overwrite [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]transaction after capture instead of clearing source_markdown, keeping [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Clear for PDF URL and arXiv and as the fallback.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Hidden-row reasons name web pages[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-hint-copy[dim] · [dim][/dim]after web-article-store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-hint-copy: in bob-mac-capture, reword the no-saved-Markdown code and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]link reasons to say Markdown or a web page, with tests and docs; no [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]logic change.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-d3","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-d3.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-d3e19f21c6a4040885e063828cf903a4","started_at":"2026-10-27T15:22:34.224742+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"88e4ba1cb7036b2b0d7195670668bdeb203537c1e0a8e7e86695daff4b14ba4e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-d3.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-d3.land/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"9b856d007e096e2015c9bc645e81775dcad8078d05de3b70fce4a16f4253537e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-d3.land/meta.json","size_bytes":716},"prompt":{"digest":"08b3ad789f1b93621334e49e730e7936fa99db709d82ecdab1866d46df1bb445","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-d3.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":309},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"ee932eca110fd15d0e99667527885da000e7cda946d48ff63d8dc1f4794afe3a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-d3.land/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":4225},"state":{"digest":"d88d8833db08cef20a610c6e6e2ed0290e47911a1bf95f5ab65589df283f8650","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-d3.land/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-d3.land","local_name":"bob-cli-d3.land","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-d3","agent_clan_generation":"20261027112205","bead_id":"bob-cli-d3","changespec_name